abelled 22 MacKenzie Street, while the commercial project profile identifies 20 McKenzie Street. The current title, address and design need reconciliation. The main hero image is illustrative; the gallery includes architect-owned preliminary massing views.</p></div></div><div class="project-gallery"><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="MacKenzie Street project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/mackenzie-preliminary-massing.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">SOURCE CONCEPT / PENDING RIGHTS</span></div><figcaption>Mackenzie Preliminary Massing</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="MacKenzie Street project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/mackenzie-context-view.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">SOURCE CONCEPT / PENDING RIGHTS</span></div><figcaption>Mackenzie Context View</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="MacKenzie Street project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/melbourne-city-reference.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">THIRD-PARTY REFERENCE</span></div><figcaption>Melbourne City Reference</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="image-wrap"><img alt="MacKenzie Street project source or reference image" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/spa-reference.jpg' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">THIRD-PARTY REFERENCE</span></div><figcaption>Spa Reference</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="section color-section"><div class="container two-column"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / THE EXPERIENCE</span><h2>Hospitality. Residences. Connection.</h2></div><p class="large-copy">The 2023 design study illustrates a signature restaurant, business club, wellness club, pool club, sky lobby, executive lounge and upper-level residences. These are concept features, not confirmed operating amenities.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-column"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / THE LOCATION</span><h2>Melbourne, Australia.</h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">The northern fringe of Melbourne CBD, with Carlton Gardens, Melbourne Museum, restaurants and cultural destinations identified in the concept study.</p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url('/lifestyle/' ) ); ?>#melbourne">Explore the local lifestyle ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-column"><div><span class="eyebrow">BEYOND THE BUILDING</span><h2>Experience Melbourne.</h2><p class="large-copy">Explore the restaurants, major sporting events, galleries, neighbourhoods and cultural destinations that make this city memorable.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url('/lifestyle/' ) ); ?>#melbourne">Explore Melbourne lifestyle →</a><p class="fine">Travel times and venue access depend on individual journeys. Lifestyle imagery is illustrative.</p></div><div class="image-wrap" style="height:480px"><img alt="Illustrative Melbourne lifestyle scene" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/images/melbourne-laneways.webp' ); ?>"/><span class="image-label">ILLUSTRATIVE IMAGE</span></div></div></section><section class="project-close"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT ENQUIRIES</span><h2>Discover more about MacKenzie Street.</h2><a class="button button-light" href="contact.html?project=mackenzie-street">Register your interest ↗</a><p class="fine light-fine">Preliminary architectural study. All specifications, imagery and appointments require approval before publication.</p></div></section></main>